# kiri doctor

kiri [version]: terminal features and settings.

## Terminal

| What | Found |
|---|---|
| Terminal | none |
| Window | unknown |
| Cell size | unknown; images take 10 × 20 pixels |
| Graphics | no |
| Text sizing | no |
| Colours | none |
| Background | unknown |
| Hyperlinks | no |
| Underline styles | no |

## Settings

| Setting | Value | From |
|---|---|---|
| Mode | auto | default |
| Theme | built-in | default |
| Margins | on | default |
| Images | on | default |
| Paging | auto | default |
| Follow | off | default |
| Search case | smart | default |
| Front matter | table | default |
| Table rows | zebra | default |
| Diagrams | on | default |
| Diagram time limit | 20 s | default |
| Diagram panels | on | default |
| Render errors | both | default |
| Largest image | 10 MB | default |
| Width | 80 cells | default |

## Files

